<title>USA: State of Montana $1.205 mln won by DA Davidson.</title>
<headline>State of Montana $1.205 mln won by DA Davidson.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>DA Davidson &amp; Co said it won $1.205 million of State of Montana, taxable coal severance tax bonds, 1997 Series A, with a true interest cost of 7.33 percent.</p>
</text>
